OL,3,GNEWSAThree Jurassic ammonites
OL,4,Adiscovered in quarry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree ammonite fossils from the
OL,7,FJurassic period have been discovered at
OL,8,Fa quarry in Rutland.
OL,10,FThe fossils were discovered by members
OL,11,Fof the Peterborough Geological &
OL,12,FPalaeontological Group (PGPG) in spoil
OL,13,Fheaps at Grange Top Quarry, Ketton
OL,14,FCement Works, Rutland County Council
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FScientists have said the ammonites have
OL,18,Fprovided new evidence about the
OL,19,FJurassic past of the county, which was
OL,20,Fcovered by a warm sea and bathed in a
OL,21,Fsubtropical climate at the time.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
